In section 19 in sub-section (2) after clause (d), the following new clauses shall be inserted, namely:- "(dd) take or accept statement of the guardian of such employee who, because of certain physical or mental disabilities (deaf, dumb, etc.) cannot give a statement about payment of wages less than the minimum rates of wages fixed for that employee's class of work, or less than the amount due to him under the provisions of the Act, (ddd) conduct any application presented under sub-section (2) of section 20 of the Act before any authority appointed under sub-section (1) of section 20 of the Act." - Bihar Ordinance No. 41 of 1982.
